    "jcr:lastModifiedBy": "kristian.bocage@stryker.com",
    "text": "<p>Glassdoor has named Stryker in their “Best Places to Work 2020” list. The list of 100 top companies is determined by Glassdoor’s Economic Research team using employee reviews. According to Glassdoor.com, their Best Places to Work list includes companies who have a mission to believe in and a strong culture, are people-focused and emphasize transparency.</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.glassdoor.com/Award/Best-Places-to-Work-LST_KQ0,19.htm\"><span style=\"color: #4c7d7a;\"><span class=\"standalone-link\">View the list</span></span></a></p>\n",
